# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4-serve-7 window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it):
# copy it over .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/serve-7 and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN.
# Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time. Every value is final.
# ORDER.txt says the order, each job's image, its stop rule and its minutes. The image is tp4-serve-7 throughout: B7 builds it, the
# later jobs serve it, and a commit after B7's tag needs a new tag and every later job the new one.
# B7: build tp4-serve-7 and smoke the PRODUCTION configuration, which is now the verified winning recipe: c2-packed-tp4 with BOTH verify
# audits OFF (QWEN_FAST_VERIFY_T1_AUDIT=0, QWEN_FAST_VERIFY_T2_AUDIT=0), the pinned sampler recorded in the verify trace
# (QWEN_FAST_PACKED_SAMPLER_IN_TRACE=1: the fix for the audits-off hang) and the tail caps on. The recipe was verified on tp4-serve-6 as the
# gate-only profile c2-packed-tp4-speed-strace (5 of 5 audits-off passes of the deterministic hang, concurrent8_code, the S3a matrix identical
# to solo twice); this job is the first boot of it under the production limits (prompts up to 123,136, answer room 8,192) and the first
# smoke of the build script's prune-safe provisional tag and of the triage probe that asks /opt/triage-venv for ttexalens.
# The test list is B5's plus the three hang shapes B5 did not run, in the order the smoke's source executes them:
# concurrent4_v164order after concurrent4, replay_concurrent4 after concurrent4_solo, concurrent8_code last.
# READ the log: '[PINDIAG] packed-any admission passed:' and no UNQUALIFIED line; no late prefill program; c2_smoke_check clean with
# audit_mismatches 0 (the verify audits are off, so no verify audit line is expected); no watchdog, stall-watch or replay-deadline exit;
# every concurrent user at 800 tokens; every concurrent4 and concurrent4_v164order hash equal to its concurrent4_solo run; the build's
# '[TRIAGE-CHECK]' line shows ttexalens present; and a throughput read-across: the strace arm measured about 23% more four-user coding
# throughput than the audited profile (concurrent4_code, concurrent4_steady).
# Duration (estimate): 60 min. Stop rule: a hang, a refusal or a divergence on this configuration stops the window.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=status reset build smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-serve-7
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,coding,long_real_text,concurrent4,concurrent4_v164order,concurrent4_steady,steady_resend,tool_call,stream_tool_call,stream_reasoning,refused_n2,alive_after_refusal,stream_dropped,alive_after_drop,concurrent4_solo,replay_concurrent4,concurrent4_code,concurrent4_code_equal,concurrent8_code
